class=\"message\"><br /> interesting,where is the image from?</div> </div> </div> </div>I found it on pinterest, it mentioned it was based on a game, but even L.A. by night had arts made about. So I thought to ask.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/038/108/378/large/denis-pospelov-sbor.jpg?1622190132\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/038/108/378/large/denis-pospelov-sbor.jpg?1622190132\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/038/108/378/large/denis-pospelov-sbor.jpg?1622190132\" target=\"_blank\"> https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/038/108/378/large/denis-pospelov-sbor.jpg?1622190132 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T07:19:42-07:00","id":1506416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506392-nine-strangers?p=1506400#post1506400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I found it on pinterest, it mentioned it was based on a game, but even L.A. by night had arts made about. So I thought to ask.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/038/108/378/large/denis-pospelov-sbor.jpg?1622190132\" target=\"_blank\">https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets...jpg?1622190132</a></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> Honestly, sounds hell of vague, could even be reference to a tabletop game the artist was part of - what in fact seems more probable to me, because the style doesn't really fit with art for official or licensed materials that i'm familiar with.<br /> <br /> Also, is it just my imagination or Vermont and Sagga seem to have a sort norse/native american mash-up Vinland kind of aesthetic going on? Just sayin'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 03-25-2023, 10:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T07:21:50-07:00","id":1506417,"title":"","content":"There's a million games all over the world, and the cast of them are important to at least a handful of people. And some of them have amazing art done for them. Heck I've had Melissa Uran do some of our Werewolf and Exalted characters over the years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T08:19:03-07:00","id":1506418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506392-nine-strangers?p=1506417#post1506417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a million games all over the world, and the cast of them are important to at least a handful of people. And some of them have amazing art done for them. Heck I've had Melissa Uran do some of our Werewolf and Exalted characters over the years.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here where I live, it's so expensive that I didn't even consider it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T08:23:08-07:00","id":1506420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506392-nine-strangers?p=1506416#post1506416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b<br /> <br /> Honestly, sounds hell of vague, could even be reference to a tabletop game the artist was part of - what in fact seems more probable to me, because the style doesn't really fit with art for official or licensed materials that i'm familiar with.<br /> <br /> Also, is it just my imagination or Vermont and Sagga seem to have a sort norse/native american mash-up Vinland kind of aesthetic going on? Just sayin'.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know if I understood correctly, but fans make art of anything just because they like it apparently, so it doesn't have to be official.<br /> <br /> And yes, it seems like these two are kind of trapped in a fantasy of their own, but from Malkavians I expect anything.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T17:45:29-07:00","id":1506445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506392-nine-strangers?p=1506418#post1506418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Here where I live, it's so expensive that I didn't even consider it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You should look around. There are artists in your country that would be willing to work for reasonable rates for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T17:53:21-07:00","id":1506446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1506392-nine-strangers?p=1506445#post1506445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You should look around. There are artists in your country that would be willing to work for reasonable rates for you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've met people who charge 40 to 50 if the art is colorful, more if I have more than one character and most of my characters die relatively quickly, so it's not even worth it. If you charge in dollars, maybe I got 300.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":